msgstr "<para>Jedan</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "A simple ball dodging game"
msgstr "Jednostavna igra izbjegavanja lopte"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Let the blue ball move in the field without touching the red balls."
msgstr ""
"Pustite plavu loptu da se pomjera po polju bez dodirivanja crvenih lopti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the empty field to start a game: a blue ball immediately replaces "
"your mouse cursor, and a number of red balls start to fade into the field."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na prazno polje da započnete igru: plava lopta odmah zamijeni vaš "
"kursor miša, i veći broj crvenih lopti dolazi u polje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the red balls finish materializing, they move at a random speed in a "
"random direction, and you have to promptly dodge them moving the blue ball "
"inside the field with your mouse. After some time, other red balls will "
"appear, fading in as before and then starting to move. Be prepared to avoid "
"them, too."
msgstr ""
"Kada se crvene lopte prestanu stvarati, pomjeraju se nasumičnom brzinom u "
"nasumičnom smjeru, i vi ih trebate u pravo vrijeme izbjeći tako što "
"pomjerate plavu loptu unutar polja sa kursorom miša. Nakon nekog vremena, "
"druge crvene lopte će se stvoriti, kao i prije i početi kretati. Budite "
"spremni da i njih izbjegnete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose the game difficulty level on the right of the status bar. The "
"higher the difficulty level, the faster red balls move, and the more balls "
"will appear on the play field."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati nivo težine igre desno od statusne trake. Što je veća "
"težina, crvene loptese brže kreću, i više lopti se pojavljuje na polju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Game Rules, Strategies and Tips</title>"
msgstr "<title>Pravila, Strategije i pomoć</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Game Rules, Strategies and Tips</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pravila, Strategije i pomoć </para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "Pravila Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Red balls move with constant speed on the game field bouncing off walls "
"until colliding with another ball, which causes the speed and direction of "
"both balls to change."
msgstr ""
"Crvene lopte se pomjeraju konstantnom brzinom na polju igre odbijajući se od "
"zidove dok se ne sudare sa drugom loptom, što uzrokuje promjenu brzine i "
"smjera kretanja obje lopte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "The blue ball can be freely moved inside the field with the mouse."
msgstr "Plava lopta može se slobodno pomjerati u polju mišem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The blue ball cannot escape the field. If the cursor is moved out, the ball "
"stays on the edge, until the cursor returns."
msgstr ""
"Plava lopta ne može izaći izvan polja. Ako se kursor pomjeri van polja, "
"lopta ostaje na ivici dok se kursor ne vrati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "The score is directly proportional to the time the game has lasted."
msgstr "Rezultat je direktno proporcionalan trajanju igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pausing the game subtracts a (cumulative) 5 seconds penalty from the total "
"time."
msgstr "Pauziranje igre oduzima (kumulativno) 5 sekundi od ukupnog vremena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move the blue ball gently and slowly. Swinging across the field will make "
"collisions with other balls more likely."
msgstr ""
"Pomjerajte plavu loptu nježno i polako. Previše pomjeranja preko polja će "
"povećati šansu sudara sa ostalim loptama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Moving the cursor out of the field can be used as an elegant trick to come "
"out of a screwed situation. Use it wisely."
msgstr ""
"Pomjeranje kursora izvan polja može biti korišteno kao elegentan trik za "
"izlazak iz zeznute situacije. Koristite ga mudro."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not pause the game unless absolutely necessary."
msgstr "Nemojte pauzirati igru ako nije baš potrebno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "Pregled Interfejsa"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "Stavke Menija"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>End game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Završi igru</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "End a game and return to the welcome screen."
msgstr "Završite igru i vratite se na početni zaslon."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pauza</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pauses or resumes the game."
msgstr "Pauzira ili opet pokreće igricu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prikaži Najbolje Rezultate</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "This will show the best scores for the current level."
msgstr "Ovo će pokazati najbolje rezultate za trenutni nivo."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izađi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting this item will end your current game, and exit &kappname;."
msgstr ""
"Selektiranje ove stavke će završiti trenutnu igru i izaći iz &kappname;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Play Sounds</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Opcije</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pusti Zvuk</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Toggle whether sound effects should be played.</action> The default "
"is off."
msgstr ""
"<action>Uključite/Isključite zvučne efekte.</action> Po defaultu je "
"isključeno."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Opcije</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Težina</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to select a difficulty <guilabel>Easy</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Medium</guilabel>, <guilabel>Hard</guilabel> for the game."
msgstr ""
"Omogućava da selektujete težinu <guilabel>Lako</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Srednje</guilabel>, <guilabel>Teško</guilabel> za igru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kappname; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kappname; ima uobičajeni &kde; <guimenu>Opcije</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke menija, za više informacije pročitajte "
"dijelove o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meniju "
"Opcija</ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Meniju "
"za pomoć</ulink>  &kde; Fundamentalnosti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljana pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>No.</para>"
msgstr "<para>Ne.</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu da igram igru?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; can only be played with a mouse."
msgstr "Ne. &kappname; se može igrati samo mišem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "Ne znam šta da radim ovdje! Možete li mi pomoći?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have a <quote>Hint</quote> feature."
msgstr "&kappname; nema <quote>Pomoć</quote> opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram izaći iz igre sada, ali još nisam završio/la. Mogu li snimiti svoj "
"rezultat?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot save games in &kappname;."
msgstr "Ne možete snimati igre u &kappname;."

